+    "screenplay": "The Lighthouse Keeper's Dilemma: The Keeper Receives the Message\n\n[1, 2, 3, 4]\n\n**Shot 1:** [Lighthouse, Lighthouse Keeper, Last Survivor]\n\n**Action:** The Keeper receives a message from the ship. She must decide whether to turn off the lamp or not.\n\n**Dialogue/Narration:**\n\n**Keeper:** I have the ability to turn off the lamp. What do I do?\n\n**Last Survivor:** Please, I need the light to be saved.\n\n**Keeper:** I will turn off the lamp. I will save you.\n\n**Shot 2:** [Lighthouse, Lighthouse Keeper, Ship]\n\n**Action:** The Keeper turns off the lamp. She rescues the last survivor.\n\n**Dialogue/Narration:**\n\n**Keeper:** The lamp is crucial for guiding ships home and ensuring safety.\n\n**Last Survivor:** Thank you, I will be safe now.\n\n**Shot 3:** [Lighthouse, Lighthouse Keeper, Ship]\n\n**Action:** The Keeper turns off the lamp. She rescues the last survivor.\n\n**Dialogue/Narration:**\n\n**Keeper:** I will turn off the lamp. I will save you.\n\n**Last Survivor:** Thank you, I will be safe now.\n\n**Shot 4:** [Lighthouse, Lighthouse Keeper, Ship]\n\n**Action:** The Keeper turns off the lamp. She rescues the last survivor.\n\n**Dialogue/Narration:**\n\n**Keeper:** I will turn off the lamp. I will save you.\n\n**Last Survivor:** Thank you, I will be safe now.\n\n**Ending:** The Keeper faces the cost of her decision. The survivor safely ashore, the Keeper facing the cost of her choice.\n\n**Ending:**\n\n**Keeper:** The lamp is crucial for guiding ships home and ensuring safety.\n\n**Last Survivor:** Thank you, I will be safe now.\n\n**Keeper:** I will turn off the lamp. I will save you.\n\n**Last Survivor:** Thank\n\nThe Lighthouse Keeper's Dilemma: Sacrifice and Resolution\n\n**Shot 5:** [Lighthouse, Lighthouse Keeper, Last Survivor]\n\n**Action:** The Keeper receives a message from the ship. She must decide whether to turn off the lamp or not.\n\n**Dialogue/Narration:**\n\n**Keeper:** I have the ability to turn off the lamp. What do I do?\n\n**Last Survivor:** Please, I need the light to be saved.\n\n**Keeper:** I will turn off the lamp. I will save you.\n\n**Shot 6:** [Lighthouse, Lighthouse Keeper, Ship]\n\n**Action:** The Keeper turns off the lamp. She rescues the last survivor.\n\n**Dialogue/Narration:**\n\n**Keeper:** The lamp is crucial for guiding ships home and ensuring safety.\n\n**Last Survivor:** Thank you, I will be safe now.\n\n**Shot 7:** [Lighthouse, Lighthouse Keeper, Ship]\n\n**Action:** The Keeper turns off the lamp. She rescues the last survivor.\n\n**Dialogue/Narration:**\n\n**Keeper:** I will turn off the lamp. I will save you.\n\n**Last Survivor:** Thank you, I will be safe now.\n\n**Shot 8:** [Lighthouse, Lighthouse Keeper, Ship]\n\n**Action:** The Keeper turns off the lamp. She rescues the last survivor.\n\n**Dialogue/Narration:**\n\n**Keeper:** I will turn off the lamp. I will save you.\n\n**Last Survivor:** Thank you, I will be safe now.\n\n**Ending:** The Keeper faces the cost of her decision. The survivor safely ashore, the Keeper facing the cost of her choice.\n\n**Ending:**\n\n**Keeper:** The lamp is crucial for guiding ships home and ensuring safety.\n\n**Last Survivor:** Thank you, I will be safe now.\n\n**Keeper:** I will turn off the lamp. I will save you.\n\n**Last Survivor:** Thank",
